            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't find a date in that picture. Try a clearer photo of the printed date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张图片里没有找到日期。请换一张更清晰的、拍到印刷日期的照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't find a recipe that uses your food. Try adding a few more basics like eggs, rice or onions, or search for a dish above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有找到能用上你食材的食谱。试着多添加一些常见食材，比如鸡蛋、米饭或洋葱，或者在上面搜索菜名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't load recipes. Please try again in a moment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法加载食谱，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't load your pantry. Please try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
