    "We couldn't search recipes. Please try again in a moment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法搜索食谱，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We couldn't see a day on the pack, so we used the last day of the month. You can change it on the next screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包装上没有看到具体的日子，所以我们用了当月的最后一天。你可以在下一页修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll nudge you before things expire so nothing goes to waste. You can change this any time in the Me tab.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "食材快到期时我们会提醒你，别让它们浪费掉。你随时可以在“我的”页面修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We'll still use the date. You can add a photo on the next screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
